1://! NVIDIA Nemotron-H — Hybrid Mamba-2 + Attention + FFN decoder.
6://!   - SSM layers (e.g. 21 in the 8B variant): Mamba-2 selective-state-space with causal conv1d.
8://!   - FFN-only layers (e.g. 17): squared-ReLU MLP (no gate tensor).
10://! * All layers share a pre-norm named `attn_norm.weight`.
13://! * Mamba-2 SSM state pre-allocated per SSM layer (zero-initialised).
